.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/*.db
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
backups
docs
*.md

# Never bake secrets into an image layer. The Dockerfile copies backend/
# wholesale, so without this a local .env — database password included — ends
# up readable by anyone who can pull the image. Templates carry no credentials
# and are allowed through.
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
